## Two additional product briefs opened to expand manufacturing-route coverage

The next two bounded style briefs are now open:

- [#12261 — K-01 Everyday Knit Tee / Quiet Second Skin](https://github.com/Luminous-Dynamics/symthaea/issues/12261): the first knit-construction reference. It compares a purchased knit-fabric cut-and-sew route with a fully-fashioned/whole-garment route only if a named machine and operator are available.
- [#12262 — T-01 Everyday Trouser / Quiet Structure](https://github.com/Luminous-Dynamics/symthaea/issues/12262): the first lower-body fit and construction reference, covering rise/crotch/seat/waist/leg geometry, seated comfort, pockets, closure, and repairability.

This gives the initial family programme four intentionally different engineering anchors:
1. AO-01 woven overshirt;
2. K-01 knit tee;
3. T-01 woven trouser;
4. CR-01 modular travel wrap.

Only AO-01 remains the first physical prototype priority. K-01 and T-01 are design/engineering briefs until fabric, fit profile, machine access, toile and sampling resources are declared. The broader style-family catalog remains a roadmap, not a commitment to sample every family at once.
